@startuml "Asset Import Export Sequence"
skinparam defaultFontSize 22
skinparam defaultFontName "Times New Roman"
skinparam sequenceMessageSize 22
actor "Ban quản lý" as Admin
participant "Giao diện" as FE
participant "AssetController" as AC
participant "AssetService" as AS
database "CSDL" as DB

== Nhập kho ==
Admin -> FE: Nhập kho
FE -> AC: POST /api/assets/import
AC -> AS: importAsset(args)
AS -> DB: INSERT asset_imports
DB --> AS: OK
AC --> FE: 201 Created

== Xuất kho ==
Admin -> FE: Xuất kho vào phòng
FE -> AC: POST /api/assets/export
AC -> AS: exportAsset(args)
AS -> DB: INSERT asset_exports
DB --> AS: OK
AC --> FE: 201 Created
@enduml
